( Emotional Toys: First Signal )
(
  Simulation-safe baseline for the first collectible interaction.

  Node 708 emits three 18-bit serial event words. The words are deliberately
  stable identifiers, not raw sensor readings and not a board pin assignment.
  They mirror DOT's embodied interaction vocabulary: light and chirp are base
  channels; haptic is reserved for a separately reviewed external ring.
  Bind implementations only after the selected Entity Nucleus wiring and
  target-node map have been reviewed.

  Run from the ga144-aforth-cli checkout:
    ./ga --run /absolute/path/to/firmware/ga144/first-signal.aforth
)

node 708
include 708serial.aforth

: signal-light 0x1e101 ;  ( DOT visual acknowledgement begins )
: signal-haptic 0x1e102 ; ( reserved external-ring haptic request )
: signal-chirp 0x1e103 ;  ( DOT audible acknowledgement begins )

: emit-event ( event-id -- )
  out18 drop ;

: first-signal
  signal-light emit-event
  signal-haptic emit-event
  signal-chirp emit-event ;

: main
  io b!
  first-signal
  exit
